    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pinning_text",
      "x": 678,
      "y": 525,
      "width": 445,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "Pinning 是扩展性风险\nJDK 21-23：synchronized 内长阻塞可能钉住 carrier\nJDK 24+：JEP 491 改善 synchronized 场景\nnative / foreign 阻塞仍要谨慎",
      "originalText": "Pinning 是扩展性风险\nJDK 21-23：synchronized 内长阻塞可能钉住 carrier\nJDK 24+：JEP 491 改善 synchronized 场景\nnative / foreign 阻塞仍要谨慎",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
